                <mxCell id="8" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;1. Developer clones the remote repository and creates a feature/** branch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Developer implements their changes and runs local unit tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Developer pushes the feature branch to GitHub and opens a Pull Request against &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Opening the PR triggers the CI workflow on GitHub Actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;The CI workflow checks out the code, installs dependencies, and runs the unit tests automatically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="105" y="873" width="656" height="235" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="9" value="Continuous Deployment" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="373" y="1198" width="100" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="10" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Once the PR is approved and merged into &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;, the CD pipeline kicks off automatically.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;The Databricks Asset Bundle (DAB) is deployed to the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Test&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; workspace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;3. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Test&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; workspace is for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;end-to-end integration and data-quality checks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;If all integration tests pass, the pipeline pauses and awaits a manual approval (via a protected GitHub Actions environment).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;After approval, the same DAB is promoted and deployed into the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot; class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Production&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; workspace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
